WEBVTT

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.480
That was close...

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.860
I thought I was going to die.

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:07.800
Was Aoi Jun here?

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:12.140
No. By the time I arrived, it was
just the victim and his familiar.

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:14.760
His familiar's acting alone?

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:16.950
What's it like?

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:21.080
I'm not sure how to describe it.

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:25.160
It seemed totally different from
the ones I've seen so far.

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:26.000
Yeah.

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:30.640
And it had completely erased its presence.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:37.140
We can't find him based on this photo alone.

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:39.320
You're defying Jun-san?

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:41.630
That ain't it, but...

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:44.140
So, who's the old man?

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:47.410
Who knows? He just said to find him.

00:00:47.410 --> 00:00:50.540
Seriously? Can we kill him?

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:51.940
No.

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:55.530
Even if we do find him, we're
supposed to keep our distance.

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:57.160
I'm starving.

00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:01.830
Hey, I bought dinner.

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:10.750
What's that?

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:12.970
Huh?

00:01:21.650 --> 00:01:24.050
Sorry I couldn't answer the phone earlier.

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:26.850
Did something happen?

00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:29.210
Not really.

00:01:32.770 --> 00:01:34.610
Uh, where's Inuki-san?

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:36.390
He's not here right now.

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:40.490
He headed out.

00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:42.910
I have a bad feeling

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:47.760
something's going to happen to Inuki-san.

00:01:48.070 --> 00:01:51.750
What the heck? Don't worry about him.

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:55.510
He's just exhausted from all his research.

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:57.750
Leave him be.

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:32.940
Bright Suit A Dark Heart

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:50.120
Why are you calling at this hour?

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:53.210
Did Inuki-san come by the church?

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:54.840
No, he didn't.

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:59.650
Could you ask the others to look for him?

00:04:00.930 --> 00:04:02.220
What's going on?

00:04:02.740 --> 00:04:05.470
I dreamed Inuki-san would die.

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:09.100
A dream? What are you talking about?

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:10.470
You have to believe me.

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:11.900
He really is in danger.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:15.640
I don't have time for your dreams.

00:04:15.640 --> 00:04:17.000
Shoko-san.

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:48.050
What can I do?

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:50.890
How can I save him?

00:04:57.680 --> 00:05:00.790
No matter how crazy,
as long as you don't give up,

00:05:00.790 --> 00:05:03.310
you'll always find a solution.

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:08.380
As long as I don't give up, even I...

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:13.000
I need to meet with and talk to him first.

00:05:16.070 --> 00:05:17.580
Where are you?

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:20.840
Kamina's looking for you.

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:23.910
Sorry.

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:26.470
What about your research?

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:30.250
I've got you, don't I?

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:33.210
You're selfish.

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:35.410
Sorry.

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:53.870
Found you.

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:04.660
We found him.

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:08.170
Where?

00:06:08.670 --> 00:06:09.550
Jun-san.

00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:13.020
What about the members he killed?

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:17.930
Let me handle it.

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:20.360
I'll settle the score.

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:28.900
You're going to wait here until Jun-san arrives.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:30.410
Jun's on his way?

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:36.410
Then you should leave.

00:06:36.670 --> 00:06:39.210
Huh? The hell does that mean?

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:40.720
You're not goin' anywhere.

00:06:40.720 --> 00:06:41.500
Inuki-san.

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:44.400
Chihiro-kun.

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:45.810
Who are you?

00:06:46.480 --> 00:06:47.780
I'm glad you're all right.

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:49.930
Don't! Stay back!

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:53.740
I've been looking for you.

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:55.600
Listen to me.

00:06:56.980 --> 00:07:00.100
You shouldn't be involved with me.

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:02.760
You might be in danger.

00:07:06.350 --> 00:07:08.050
Get lost, kid.

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:09.510
You wanna die?

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:14.030
Stay out of my way.
I have no business with you.

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:15.260
Bastard!

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:16.490
Don't underestimate us!

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:17.670
You wanna fight? Huh?

00:07:33.770 --> 00:07:34.670
Inuki-san?

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:37.010
He ran!

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:37.810
Shit!

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:38.810
He ran!

00:07:39.110 --> 00:07:40.780
You can't be serious!

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:43.440
It's your fault he got away!

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:45.880
Jun-san's headed this way!

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:48.090
How are you gonna make up for this?

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:49.880
Why?

00:07:58.690 --> 00:07:59.870
Did you find him?

00:08:03.090 --> 00:08:04.420
I'm not surprised.

00:08:09.690 --> 00:08:12.060
I've identified the traitor.

00:08:12.060 --> 00:08:12.660
What?

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:15.430
It's Akaya Inuki.

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:26.190
This is the orphanage Hikari-en.

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:31.030
Akaya Inuki and Aoi Jun were raised here.

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:34.200
They were practically brothers.

00:08:34.460 --> 00:08:37.450
So he belonged to the other
side this whole time.

00:08:38.060 --> 00:08:40.950
No wonder he always opposed everything.

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:42.650
Hold on.

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:46.650
We can't call him a traitor
based on this photo alone.

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:52.350
The orphanage where he was raised is
managed by the AVAL Science Foundation.

00:08:52.350 --> 00:08:54.800
What? That AVAL?

00:08:55.260 --> 00:09:01.150
From daily necessities to large scale
public works, they have a clean image,

00:09:01.150 --> 00:09:03.520
but behind the scenes their hands are sullied

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:06.030
with weapons development
and illegal experiments.

00:09:06.030 --> 00:09:09.150
The AVAL Science Foundation is our enemy.

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:12.020
We now know they're agents of Chaos.

00:09:12.020 --> 00:09:13.220
What?

00:09:13.220 --> 00:09:16.490
Thanks to Akaya, we know who our enemies are.

00:09:18.810 --> 00:09:20.540
I refuse to believe this.

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:24.480
Look.

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:29.840
The foundation's president,
Shiraki Aldo Grumman.

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:35.220
The girl next to him is his
daughter, Shiraki Yuri.

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:37.910
You recognize her, don't you?

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.140
Yeah, that's right.

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:47.820
Inuki's the one who leaked the strategy.

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:49.110
Why?

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:53.280
To protect the children of Hikari-en.

00:09:54.550 --> 00:09:58.780
It's within the area of
the barrier near the tower.

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:04.340
If we'd destroyed it, those children would be...

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:07.780
I...

00:10:08.970 --> 00:10:11.810
It's fine. It's not your fault.

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:18.970
He just wanted to protect our home and family.

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:19.800
What?

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:23.820
I was raised at Hikari-en, too.

00:10:27.900 --> 00:10:31.760
It's an experimental education facility.

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:53.790
We were discarded as failed experiments.

00:10:54.930 --> 00:10:57.800
Because of that, we survived,

00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:03.800
but he's still suffering from the
aftereffects of the experiments.

00:11:07.630 --> 00:11:10.240
Inuki's out of time.

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:21.580
Did you know?

00:11:34.990 --> 00:11:36.730
What was that smile?

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:39.580
Pretty, aren't they?

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:44.030
It's called rosemary.

00:11:52.180 --> 00:11:54.650
Shiraki Yuri.

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:04.850
The hot cocoa we drank here was really good.

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:07.950
I tried making some,

00:12:08.340 --> 00:12:11.910
but it never turned out as
good as your mother's.

00:12:15.050 --> 00:12:17.990
Sorry, I don't remember.

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:22.680
I learned your name after
someone else told me.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:24.590
I see.

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:38.820
I have nothing. I can't do anything.

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:45.240
Even though I'm about to lose
someone important again.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:49.880
That's not true.

00:12:50.610 --> 00:12:53.480
I know you'll be fine, Chihiro-kun.

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:57.600
If you don't mind, I'll help you.

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:06.760
It's strange.

00:13:07.210 --> 00:13:12.770
When I'm with you, I don't care
about enemies or allies anymore.

00:13:14.260 --> 00:13:17.270
I have a lot of questions for you.

00:13:18.630 --> 00:13:19.540
Like what?

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:23.170
About the important things I've lost.

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:35.930
While we're here, I'd like
to forget about fighting.

00:13:41.260 --> 00:13:43.900
Can I sit next to you?

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:05.650
It's me.

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:09.680
Jun-san's summoning us.

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:11.340
We're meeting up with the main gang.

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:17.680
Why don't you tell me more about that?

00:14:27.570 --> 00:14:28.800
I'm sorry.

00:14:30.110 --> 00:14:31.680
Your friends...

00:14:33.840 --> 00:14:35.220
I know.

00:14:38.900 --> 00:14:42.800
I can barely hold it together
with my Heroic Lineage power.

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:47.060
Please.

00:14:54.970 --> 00:14:58.250
Come with me. There must be a way.

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:01.350
I can't. I won't return to the Foundation.

00:15:01.350 --> 00:15:03.070
This is no time for that!

00:15:03.520 --> 00:15:05.610
You're the only one I can ask!

00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:06.960
Don't be selfish!

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:10.470
You're the closest thing I have to a brother!

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:13.820
I know. That's why you...

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:16.450
Inuki!

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:18.870
Q-Quickly. Kill me.

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:24.390
Let me die as your brother!

00:15:32.580 --> 00:15:33.530
Stop!

00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:36.430
Chihiro-kun!

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:47.900
Even his Heroic Lineage is out of control?

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:53.090
He's trying to use his blood
armaments in that form?

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:55.140
Inuki-san.

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:02.020
Impossible.

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:09.780
We're looking for Aoi Jun.

00:16:10.460 --> 00:16:12.120
He's not here.

00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:15.490
You know where he is, don't you?

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:18.960
Heroic Lineage?

00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:21.070
Yeah.

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:24.490
This got complicated.

00:16:24.490 --> 00:16:27.590
Let's see what they do. Until then...

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.320
I know.

00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:44.440
Please stop!

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:46.250
Don't you recognize me?!

00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:51.570
Why is this happening?

00:16:59.500 --> 00:17:01.260
Such power...

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:16.460
I have to save Inuki-san.

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:19.170
I... I can...

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:23.370
Remember that feeling.

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:40.030
More. It's not enough!

00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:47.250
Idiot. You'll overflow immediately
if you use it like that.

00:17:49.990 --> 00:17:52.190
I could do it back then!

00:17:52.190 --> 00:17:54.420
My power's not listening to me!

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:06.050
It vanished?

00:18:58.510 --> 00:19:01.010
He's trying to increase his power.

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:03.050
It's as if he's...

00:19:07.590 --> 00:19:09.140
The Lord of Vermilion.

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:18.170
Stop!

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:27.060
Inuki?

00:19:33.130 --> 00:19:35.200
What was that?

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:38.110
What an ominous light.

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:42.080
Jun-san.

00:19:58.650 --> 00:20:00.640
He's absorbing his power.

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:05.940
Are you...

00:20:10.510 --> 00:20:12.630
You can't become like me.

00:20:13.570 --> 00:20:15.090
Keep fighting.

00:20:15.530 --> 00:20:17.550
Don't give in to despair.

00:20:18.100 --> 00:20:20.030
Stop! You'll die!

00:20:21.350 --> 00:20:24.280
As long as you don't give up,
your wishes will come true.

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:28.410
Control your power. Save the others.

00:20:30.170 --> 00:20:31.650
Stop, Inuki!

00:20:31.650 --> 00:20:32.940
Please stop!

00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:37.000
Show me the future you'll create.

00:20:44.030 --> 00:20:46.880
I believe in you, Chihiro.

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:49.910
Don't die, Inuki!

00:21:29.110 --> 00:21:30.210
Inuki-san...

00:21:33.530 --> 00:21:37.200
Do you really think I can do it?
